  "description": "Event-sourcing add-on for the Excalibur operational dashboard: adds the projection/CDC-lag read panel (per-subscription lag against the global stream head). Opt-in via AddProjectionLagDashboard(); keeps the base dashboard package free of an event-sourcing dependency. PRE-RELEASE: the public API is not frozen and may change between pre-release builds. Not recommended for production use. Known issues: https://docs.excalibur-dispatch.dev/docs/known-issues",
